    "detailed_description": "We present to you GRIM, a spooky narrative game where the player is dead and through the possession of various objects as a ghost, players can make world-shaping decisions that decide the fate of their twin trapped inside the same house with a vicious monster! You and Jia must fight off the monsters of the night, figure out what happened to your parents, and reveal the dark passages, hidden away from innocent eyes.<br><br>Inspired by the different retellings of the original Taiwanese folklore \u201cAunt Tiger\u201d, Grim provides players with a unique experience exploring an immersive 3D environment and a dynamic narrative where players will uncover different storylines based on their decisions. As a ghost, players can possess objects and toggle different physics-based movements with unique controls depending on various items.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801860/extras/ca64f1762fc2cb72f9bf6b79cbf2f122.avif?t=1725061201\" width=600 height=172 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "We present to you GRIM, a spooky narrative game where the player is dead and through the possession of various objects as a ghost, players can make world-shaping decisions that decide the fate of their twin trapped inside the same house with a vicious monster! You and Jia must fight off the monsters of the night, figure out what happened to your parents, and reveal the dark passages, hidden away from innocent eyes.<br><br>Inspired by the different retellings of the original Taiwanese folklore \u201cAunt Tiger\u201d, Grim provides players with a unique experience exploring an immersive 3D environment and a dynamic narrative where players will uncover different storylines based on their decisions. As a ghost, players can possess objects and toggle different physics-based movements with unique controls depending on various items.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801860/extras/ca64f1762fc2cb72f9bf6b79cbf2f122.avif?t=1725061201\" width=600 height=172 /></span>",
    "short_description": "Grim is a horror game inspired from Taiwanese folklore \u201cAunt Tiger\u201d. The player will play in a room-oriented 3rd-person perspective as a \u201cghost\u201d and will observe the world from fixed camera perspectives to solve puzzles and survive the monster\u2019s pursuit.",
